<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.25     loss	 $0.23</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,410     loss	 1,332</p>
<p> Revs		     169,741		  167,090</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,479		   15,252</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating income for the first quarter was $7.3 million, compared with $6.5 million for the same period a year earlier.</p>
